/target

# Vendored proto dependencies — regenerate with `cargo xtask vendor-proto`.
# Committed copies of Google files would be linted as if they were ours.
/protobuf/.deps
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Local data + models — never committed
/data
/models
*.gguf
*.bin.zst
*.html

.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
.claude/
AGENT_*.md
AGENTS.md
docs/STATUS.md

# Evaluation datasets. Fetched by examples/datasets/download.sh.
/examples/datasets/*/

# Descriptor set consumed by `buffers generate`. A build artifact of `buf build`,
# reproducible from the protos, so it is rebuilt rather than committed.
/descriptors.binpb

# Generated Rust now lives in telividb-buffers and is committed, the same way
# telividb-proto commits its prost output: `cargo build` needs neither capnp nor
# flatc installed. Nothing to ignore here any more.
